Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.77,0:00:05.92,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sick of walking!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.92,0:00:07.73,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.73,0:00:10.93,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Don't wanna! Carry me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.94,0:00:12.40,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Inaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.14,0:00:13.70,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, Taichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:13.70,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Can you give me a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:15.49,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,She's going through an episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:18.28,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I don't wanna walk anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.49,0:00:18.21,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Not my problem. You deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.21,0:00:19.92,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Inaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.92,0:00:23.70,CRKokoro,Wata,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, why are you guys fooling around?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.70,0:00:24.96,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Yaegashi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:26.82,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,If you use this trip as an excuse to do
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.82,0:00:29.46,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,unspeakable things to \NNagase-san, you'll pay dearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.46,0:00:31.65,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't make it sound like I'm a bad guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.65,0:00:34.68,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Taichi! Carry me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.11,0:00:41.02,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Isn't there something else \Nyou care about just as much?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.02,0:00:43.47,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Nagase! Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.47,0:00:44.60,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Inaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.60,0:00:46.09,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Help me out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.09,0:00:47.38,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Inaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.01,0:02:28.96,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe we have to \Nuse a dump like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.96,0:02:31.75,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, it's my fault for losing \Nat rock-paper-scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.04,0:02:33.67,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you couldn't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.16,0:02:36.25,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Yaegashi-kun, you will \Nbe punished later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.25,0:02:36.90,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.90,0:02:39.90,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Watase-kun, can you think \Nof a suitable punishment?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.90,0:02:40.93,CRKokoro,Wata,0000,0000,0000,,I would love to!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.93,0:02:42.39,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,You look happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.39,0:02:43.38,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Now, now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.38,0:02:46.19,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,We'll all look back on \Nthis as a fond memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.19,0:02:47.57,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Right, Inaban?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.57,0:02:50.47,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I don't need any negative memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.71,0:02:59.14,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.14,0:03:01.93,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,How can you be so bad \Nat rock-paper-scissors?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.91,0:03:05.37,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,You couldn't beat Iori \Nor Watase, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.36,0:03:08.63,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Right, according to my TV \Nhoroscope this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.63,0:03:10.65,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,I have the worst possible luck today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.65,0:03:12.67,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,That could be a factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.67,0:03:14.61,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.25,0:03:18.42,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,The fall would kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.71,0:03:21.35,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,With your luck, you need \Nto be extra careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.35,0:03:25.11,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,The only reason I'd fall \Nis if I were to jump off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.11,0:03:27.06,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you smiling?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.06,0:03:28.81,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,You were depressed a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:35.81,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it feels like it's been ages since \Nwe just chatted about nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.16,0:03:40.38,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,What? You don't have to \Nbe so upset about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.38,0:03:41.31,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.29,0:03:55.13,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Are the three of them doing okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.13,0:03:56.79,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,They're probably fine
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.79,0:03:59.76,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,since Inaba-chan is recovering.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.18,0:04:01.47,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.47,0:04:03.78,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,You look great!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.78,0:04:08.10,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,There's something about girls \Nwith long hair in aprons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.56,0:04:11.56,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,You're so laid back that \NI'm actually impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.04,0:04:14.69,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,What does it take to \Nnever have to worry?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.90,0:04:20.58,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,You're pretty good, Nagase.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.58,0:04:22.78,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I do a lot of cooking at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.78,0:04:23.98,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.64,0:04:29.49,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Yours look a little rough, Inaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.49,0:04:30.16,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Oops!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.12,0:04:33.87,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Don't make fun of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.87,0:04:36.72,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I'm awesome at this if I try hard enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.71,0:04:37.92,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Wanna see?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.92,0:04:39.67,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-Why are you so excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.68,0:04:40.80,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Are you having an episode?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:43.63,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,So what if Taichi gave you \Na little compliment, Iori?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:45.17,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't be too \Nhappy with yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.17,0:04:46.51,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,How did I get pulled into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.51,0:04:48.95,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Let's race to see who \Ncan chop these faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.29,0:04:55.00,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,A-Am I supposed to do that, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.98,0:04:56.77,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.61,0:04:59.27,CRKokoro,Wata,0000,0000,0000,,I got the rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.91,0:05:02.42,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you're getting along just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.42,0:05:05.00,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,I was right to assign all \Nof you to the same group.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.00,0:05:05.90,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,How do you figure?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.92,0:05:20.28,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Can we start, Fujishima-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.29,0:05:21.92,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:23.88,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Not yet. Wait a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:25.61,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.61,0:05:27.75,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,The other groups already started eating!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.75,0:05:29.02,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:32.22,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,I just added the last original spice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.22,0:05:33.42,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:36.56,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,You're pretty picky about your cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:38.91,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Not always.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.91,0:05:40.27,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Only when it's curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.27,0:05:41.07,CRKokoro,All,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.28,0:05:43.57,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, it's ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.31,0:05:49.84,CRKokoro,All,0000,0000,0000,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:53.24,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Hunger is the best spice, \Nsecond only to love!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.55,0:05:56.36,CRKokoro,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Um, are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.36,0:05:58.26,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm too busy eating this good food!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.26,0:06:00.04,CRKokoro,Wata,0000,0000,0000,,I was listening to every word!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.04,0:06:01.13,CRKokoro,Wata,0000,0000,0000,,Love is the answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.44,0:06:05.63,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,You don't mean love in \Na weird way, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.63,0:06:07.20,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't be too sure about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.20,0:06:08.51,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, Nagase-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.59,0:06:11.55,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,There's rice on your cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.54,0:06:13.00,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay! It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.00,0:06:14.46,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I can get it myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.46,0:06:15.54,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.85,0:06:19.21,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's focus on eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.09,0:06:27.59,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,That was so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.59,0:06:28.70,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.70,0:06:31.24,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't mind going \Non a picnic every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.24,0:06:32.24,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:38.55,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Say, Inaban...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.55,0:06:39.79,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Inaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.79,0:06:41.74,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you bleeding?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.99,0:06:45.25,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Look here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.68,0:06:47.63,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.63,0:06:49.99,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,How did you not notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.99,0:06:51.76,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,What if it gets infected?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.76,0:06:53.97,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I can wash my own hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.97,0:06:55.50,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Does anyone have a band-aid?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.50,0:06:58.14,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine. I brought my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.69,0:07:04.37,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be back in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.22,0:07:06.73,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, Nagase!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:12.86,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Man, they need to mind \Ntheir own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.39,0:07:34.64,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What is it, Iori?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.98,0:07:37.39,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Inaban, are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.68,0:07:38.43,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.40,0:07:46.10,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Are you in love with...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.81,0:07:49.19,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, Inaban!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.53,0:07:50.36,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She knows!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.19,0:07:52.79,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She knows! She knows!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.38,0:07:54.54,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She knows!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.73,0:08:03.23,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Where did Nagase and Inaba go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.79,0:08:14.03,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Inaban!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.50,0:08:15.51,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Inaban!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.81,0:08:16.89,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Inaban!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.51,0:08:26.48,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Inaban!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.07,0:08:30.40,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Tell me why...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.78,0:08:32.86,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Inaban...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.15,0:08:35.71,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Tell me why...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.99,0:08:41.50,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Are you in love with Taichi too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.75,0:08:49.09,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.46,0:08:53.51,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,You kept trying to push \NTaichi and me together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.51,0:08:56.51,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,You always said that you \Nwanted us to be a couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.88,0:09:01.33,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I knew that you cared about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.33,0:09:04.89,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,But wasn't that only as a friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:10.10,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Why were you trying to get us together?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.72,0:09:12.92,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Did you want to let me have him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.17,0:09:15.56,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Inaban...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.54,0:09:19.53,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Explain yourself, Inaba Himeko!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.53,0:09:22.06,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Iori, are you having an episo—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.06,0:09:24.39,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,What's that mean?! What's that mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.39,0:09:26.29,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,What's that supposed to mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.29,0:09:28.67,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't give me an explanation, \NI'm no longer your friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.77,0:09:33.13,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.13,0:09:34.38,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.38,0:09:36.51,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,That's the only way the five \Nof us can stay together!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.51,0:09:38.55,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Why would you think that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.55,0:09:42.47,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Well, when you have a \Ngroup of boys and girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.47,0:09:46.31,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,and love comes in and complicates \Nthings, there will be arguments.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.32,0:09:49.22,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Friendships fall apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.98,0:09:52.46,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Aoki loves Yui,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.46,0:09:53.94,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,and despite what she says,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.94,0:09:55.66,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,Yui doesn't mind his attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.66,0:09:59.22,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,You're looking for \Nsomeone to support you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.22,0:10:01.98,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,and Taichi's naturally inclined to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.60,0:10:06.96,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,If the two of you get together, \Neverything will work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.41,0:10:11.79,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Then the five of us will \Nalways be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.39,0:10:13.96,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Are you an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.57,0:10:16.69,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Everything will work out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.20,0:10:20.56,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I never realized that Inaba \NHimeko was such an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.89,0:10:24.14,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I was always alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.89,0:10:26.89,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Always by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.15,0:10:31.54,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,But in high school, I made \Nfriends for the first time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.13,0:10:35.83,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't want to lose those friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.83,0:10:38.94,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't know what else to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.94,0:10:40.32,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.65,0:10:42.66,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,If you feel lonely, you \Nshould say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.66,0:10:44.98,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,If you're worried, say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.87,0:10:50.01,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Most people aren't as sharp as you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.01,0:10:51.84,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,If you want those people \Nto understand you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.84,0:10:53.22,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,you should say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.22,0:10:54.39,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you're worried that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.39,0:10:56.55,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,you'll embarrass yourself, \Nyou should still say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.55,0:10:58.17,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.62,0:11:00.39,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,If I show people how weak I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.39,0:11:02.43,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,they won't need me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.11,0:11:06.02,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't have a choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.02,0:11:08.09,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,What else was I supposed to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.09,0:11:09.80,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't need to do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.80,0:11:11.03,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I don't believe that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.03,0:11:14.73,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,A worthless, unwanted failure like me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.73,0:11:16.36,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Don't say "like me"!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.36,0:11:18.39,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Don't talk about yourself like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.39,0:11:19.74,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,But it's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.74,0:11:22.62,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not a good person \Nlike the rest of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.61,0:11:25.95,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,How do you think that makes me feel
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.95,0:11:27.08,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,for liking Inaba Himeko?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.24,0:11:39.10,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I really like you a lot, Inaban. A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.67,0:11:42.39,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't realize that, \NI'll say it a million times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.39,0:11:45.43,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I love you. We all do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.74,0:11:48.93,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,But that's the fake Inaba Himeko
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.93,0:11:51.77,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,who's strong and knows what she's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.23,0:11:55.61,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like you no matter \Nwhat a mess you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.31,0:11:57.69,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.69,0:11:59.40,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,You're wrong, Inaban.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.02,0:12:04.00,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,You're a much better \Nperson than you realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.46,0:12:06.63,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.63,0:12:07.79,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,That's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.33,0:12:10.99,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,You can't label people as good or bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.99,0:12:13.08,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,It's not that simple!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.29,0:12:14.81,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Trust me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.81,0:12:15.79,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,If you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.79,0:12:19.61,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,If you think I'm a good person,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.61,0:12:22.47,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,you should trust my words!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.81,0:12:25.78,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay, Inaban!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.78,0:12:27.91,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.91,0:12:30.97,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll always be your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.97,0:12:34.07,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not quite right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.07,0:12:37.11,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I want to always be your friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.11,0:12:39.39,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Please let me be your friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.53,0:12:44.07,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I've...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.61,0:12:49.74,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I've always wanted to \Nhear someone say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:54.83,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,But it's too late now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.79,0:12:59.35,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I'd only be a third wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.90,0:13:03.96,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,And I don't want to \Nruin the StuCS bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.89,0:13:07.26,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,So I can't go back to the clubroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.60,0:13:10.38,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Why not? What makes you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.39,0:13:13.60,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it would be really awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.62,0:13:14.77,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone would feel uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.23,0:13:17.23,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Remember what you just said?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.81,0:13:20.67,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,If Taichi and I got together, \Neverything would work out?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.12,0:13:24.87,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,But wouldn't it also work out if you and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.87,0:13:27.03,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,Taichi got together instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.03,0:13:31.28,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,But you and Taichi are a good match.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.28,0:13:37.00,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,And I didn't really care about \NTaichi in the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.21,0:13:38.79,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Er, I still don't, really...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.79,0:13:41.55,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you still lying to yourself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:43.55,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.87,0:13:48.57,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,You were trying hard to protect \Nour friendship, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.57,0:13:51.14,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,But you love Taichi so much now that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.14,0:13:53.39,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,you can't hold yourself back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.97,0:13:58.34,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,The Inaba Himeko I know \Nwould fight for both!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.85,0:14:01.39,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,She would never give up, \Nno matter the odds!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.39,0:14:03.84,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Arrogant and patronizing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.84,0:14:05.91,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Using people to her advantage!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.91,0:14:08.10,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Willing to do whatever it takes \Nto accomplish her goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.10,0:14:09.82,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,That's the Inaba Himeko I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.23,0:14:14.09,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, the friendship \Nbetween Nagase Iori
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.09,0:14:16.69,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,and Inaba Himeko isn't going to end
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.69,0:14:18.96,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,because of a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.12,0:14:23.51,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,That's what I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.15,0:14:27.04,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,So you don't need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.04,0:14:29.43,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,You can come back to the clubroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.32,0:14:35.93,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.37,0:14:39.60,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Don't blame me if you regret it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.19,0:14:42.44,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I'm no pushover.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.44,0:14:45.36,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,If that's how you want \Nit, I'll be going all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.35,0:14:47.69,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to be crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.69,0:14:49.19,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Just so you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.19,0:14:51.34,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't plan on losing or giving him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.34,0:14:54.37,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,And do you really think \Nyou can beat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.37,0:14:56.79,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,There are plenty of ways \Nto beat a girl
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.79,0:14:58.20,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,who's got nothing but a cute face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.20,0:14:59.64,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.74,0:15:05.93,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, you were pretty intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.93,0:15:08.56,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Was that really me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.55,0:15:10.80,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, when did my episode—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:14.39,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Iori?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.06,0:15:22.52,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,So, I want to set the \Nrecord straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.52,0:15:23.86,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.86,0:15:25.40,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you show up now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.73,0:15:30.34,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I wanted to tell \Nyou that this unleashing
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.34,0:15:32.86,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,of desire business is about to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.86,0:15:35.37,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,End? Is it all over?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.71,0:15:39.11,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,But there's been an accident,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.82,0:15:43.00,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,and I thought it would be more amusing,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:44.75,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,or better, to let you know—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.75,0:15:46.67,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I don't understand what \Nyou're talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.12,0:15:49.97,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Yaegashi-san fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.97,0:15:50.55,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:53.93,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Yaegashi-san fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.93,0:15:55.47,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Fell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.97,0:15:57.81,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,You mean he fell off that cliff?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.81,0:16:06.61,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Taichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.32,0:16:08.19,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Taichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.52,0:16:09.21,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Taichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.65,0:16:12.65,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This isn't like what \Nhappened with Nagase-san.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.65,0:16:15.24,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I didn't do a thing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:17.41,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}So why did he fall?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.41,0:16:19.99,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That selfless freak{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.99,0:16:22.71,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}is really something.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.96,0:16:32.13,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.13,0:16:34.70,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Geez, don't make us worry like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.70,0:16:36.55,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,We ran over here for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:37.61,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.61,0:16:40.51,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,Yui and I were enjoying quality \Ntime cleaning up together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.51,0:16:41.73,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,That's irrelevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.35,0:16:47.20,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Inaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.20,0:16:48.86,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,You look really pale.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.86,0:16:51.21,CRKokoro,Wata,0000,0000,0000,,Wasn't Nagase-san with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.03,0:16:54.17,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.17,0:16:55.86,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Taichi did something stupid again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.19,0:16:59.70,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,He was trying to help a kitten \Nthat was stuck in a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.38,0:17:02.83,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,And he ended up falling down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.32,0:17:05.33,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,What about the cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.33,0:17:06.72,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:10.94,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,It's a good thing that \Nneither of you were hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.23,0:17:15.44,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about all the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.44,0:17:18.90,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Honestly, you and your false alarms.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.90,0:17:22.35,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Well, at least we get to laugh it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.50,0:17:25.46,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Inaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.11,0:17:33.78,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong, Inaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.78,0:17:36.55,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Don't make me worry, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.53,0:17:39.24,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, that was uncalled for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:44.50,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Er, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.50,0:17:45.55,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.55,0:17:47.17,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what's wrong, \Nbut it was all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.17,0:17:48.22,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.22,0:17:49.58,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,So stop crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.47,0:17:52.69,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Inaba, you don't need to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.69,0:17:54.97,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Look, Taichi's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.46,0:17:57.56,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,What? Were you really that worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.56,0:17:59.76,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,You can stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.76,0:18:01.97,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Stop crying, Inaba-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.96,0:18:04.48,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I finally made it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.48,0:18:06.74,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Iori, where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.73,0:18:09.06,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'm not really sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.96,0:18:11.91,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Um, what's wrong with Inaban?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.90,0:18:14.65,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, we're not sure either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.65,0:18:17.54,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Inaba, I'm not sure what's \Nwrong, but I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.54,0:18:18.72,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,It was all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.72,0:18:20.21,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Inaba, Inaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.21,0:18:21.57,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,You can stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.57,0:18:23.97,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Taichi's fine, Inaba-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.95,0:18:26.83,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Inaban, Inaban? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.90,0:18:40.30,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,So these episodes of our desires \Ngetting unleashed are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.91,0:18:44.01,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Starting tomorrow, it's back \Nto working on the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.43,0:18:46.72,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Is it really over?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:50.06,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it might be something \Nelse next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.06,0:18:52.88,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,No point in worrying about that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.88,0:18:56.57,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,We should enjoy the \Nfreedom we have now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.57,0:18:58.17,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.17,0:19:01.82,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,What does it take to \Nnever have to worry?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.82,0:19:02.92,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.92,0:19:04.49,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,What happened to Taichi and Inaba-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.49,0:19:05.53,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.53,0:19:08.91,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe Fujishima-san's yelling \Nat them about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.91,0:19:10.00,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.99,0:19:10.81,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, in that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.81,0:19:12.17,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,We should head home then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:29.69,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey, Inaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:34.31,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,You wanted to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.96,0:19:41.45,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.67,0:19:45.03,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:51.64,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.42,0:19:53.63,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.26,0:20:02.77,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.24,0:20:08.35,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm happy to hear you say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.95,0:20:11.73,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I truly feel honored, from \Nthe bottom of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.13,0:20:15.86,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,But right now, I'm in love with Nagase.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.46,0:20:22.89,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I already knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.43,0:20:24.88,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,But "right now" means that
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.88,0:20:26.83,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,I still have a chance \Nto change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.82,0:20:29.29,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,U-Uh, that wasn't what I meant...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.29,0:20:33.29,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Since you and Iori \Naren't going out yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.79,0:20:35.92,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,there's plenty of room for \Nme to worm myself in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.93,0:20:40.34,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,And I already told Iori \Nabout this beforehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.92,0:20:42.38,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,So don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.38,0:20:45.60,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to have a fair fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:49.10,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,so you can do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.10,0:20:52.23,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,W-Wait! You're moving too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.23,0:20:53.50,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.48,0:20:56.48,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,It almost sounds like the two \Nof you are fighting over me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.89,0:21:04.02,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,You took my first one without asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:06.01,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Another one can't hurt, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.61,0:21:09.23,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I'll see you in the clubroom tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.39,0:21:31.57,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so embarrassed I could die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.57,0:21:32.89,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I kissed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.19,0:21:53.84,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.84,0:21:55.47,CRKokoro,Bro,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on, Himeko?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.47,0:21:57.17,CRKokoro,Bro,0000,0000,0000,,You usually leave \Nwithout saying a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.79,0:22:01.05,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up, stupid.
